WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.980
- All right, now it's time
to close out that show

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:04.770
with something I hope will
add even more joy to your day.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:07.107
This is What I'm Liking.

00:00:07.107 --> 00:00:10.170
(audience cheering)

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:12.180
Well, Bella is clearly
her dad's little girl.

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:13.920
Now, I want you to meet another father,

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:16.080
who'd do anything to
make his daughter smile.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:16.980
Seven year old, Bailey,

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:19.740
was devastated when she let
go of her brand new balloon.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.690
It got stuck on the ceiling.

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:23.550
So, her dad sprung into action,

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:25.987
well, pretty much literally.

00:00:25.987 --> 00:00:29.237
(heroic horns blowing)

00:00:31.213 --> 00:00:34.046
(audience cheers)

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:41.573
Nice job.

00:00:41.573 --> 00:00:43.072
We have James on the line right now.

00:00:43.072 --> 00:00:44.491
Along with his wife Yui,

00:00:44.491 --> 00:00:47.013
and two of their kids Bailey and Hazel.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:51.600
Hi guys. How are ya? (laughs)

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.010
James nice moves there.

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:54.060
You're a real pro.

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:55.500
Are you an athlete?

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.830
- Yeah, so I saw the
look on my daughters face

00:00:58.830 --> 00:01:00.480
whenever she lost the balloon,

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:03.240
and I was like man I
gotta get this balloon.

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:06.390
So, I was like let me see
if my legs still got it.

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:08.220
It's going back to my football,

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:10.410
basketball, and track days.

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:13.350
So, I tried to jump and grab it twice,

00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:14.970
and I was just a little short.

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:16.177
So, I turned to my wife and I was like,

00:01:16.177 --> 00:01:18.780
"Hey babe, take it and record this."

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:20.280
She had no idea what I
was getting ready to try.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:21.984
So, I stepped back.

00:01:21.984 --> 00:01:24.630
I wiped my shoes off to
make sure I had some grip

00:01:24.630 --> 00:01:25.470
on the wall.

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:28.170
I ran and I jumped and
I was able to grab it.

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:30.030
- Well that was great. Pretty amazing.

00:01:30.030 --> 00:01:31.050
Now, Bailey.

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:32.160
Bailey, let me ask.

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:34.023
What was it like when your
dad gave your balloon back?

00:01:34.023 --> 00:01:36.060
That was pretty cool.

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:38.580
- It was the best thing
my daddy ever did for me,

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:39.897
and I was very surprised.

00:01:42.227 --> 00:01:44.340
- That's the best thing daddy ever did.

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:45.420
All right, James.

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:47.220
Yui, Bailey, and Hazel.

00:01:47.220 --> 00:01:49.050
I'm liking your post right now.

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:51.510
Thanks you guys. Nice job.

00:01:51.510 --> 00:01:52.343
That's not all.

00:01:52.343 --> 00:01:55.800
The show's season long partner
Pilot Pen, makers of Frixion,

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:58.260
the go to erasable pen of
the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:00.158
wants to celebrate those
creating fearlessly.

00:02:00.158 --> 00:02:01.380
Just like you guys.

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:03.930
So, they're giving you $1,000.

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:05.108
There you go.

00:02:05.108 --> 00:02:06.577
All right.
- Thank you!

00:02:06.577 --> 00:02:08.640
- Thanks to all our guests this hour.

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:11.220
Anna Chlumsky, Cam, Anjelah Johnson-Reyes,

00:02:11.220 --> 00:02:12.480
Christian, Lisa, Bella,

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:13.770
and Blessing Offor.

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:15.870
You can see a new season
of Jay Leno's Garage

00:02:15.870 --> 00:02:17.490
in September on CNBC.

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:20.550
And check out local listing
to watch You Bet Your Life.

00:02:20.550 --> 00:02:21.397
As Kelly says,

00:02:21.397 --> 00:02:24.270
"Have a great day. If it's not change it."

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:25.293
Thanks everybody.

